        <div class="k">Totals</div>
        <div class="v" id="totalsResult" style="font-size:16px; margin-top:10px; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.5;">Total Points: -<br>Total Cash Spent: -</div>
